      </div>
      <p class="font-body text-sm text-header-foreground/45 italic mb-5 leading-relaxed">
        On the strange dream most people are sleeping inside, and what is waiting underneath it.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-header-foreground/40 font-body">
        <span>May 2026</span>
        <span class="text-header-foreground/20">&middot;</span>
        <span>6 min read</span>
        <span class="text-header-foreground/20">&middot;</span>
        <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-body tracking-wider uppercase rounded-full border border-primary/15 text-primary/50">Psychology</span>
